#: ../../source/docs/thrusters.rst:5 b0b06c9e44824630981930f792fade05
msgid "Thrusters (for boats and submarines)"
msgstr "推进器（适用于船和潜水艇）"

#: ../../source/docs/thrusters.rst:9 14b457ecd51c4f8bae44dbc8950d287d
msgid ""
"The `BlueRobotics T100, T200 and T500 thrusters "
"<https://www.bluerobotics.com/product-category/thrusters/>`__ are commonly "
"used thrusters that can be controlled using :ref:`regular reversible "
"brushless motor ESCs <common-brushless-escs>`"
msgstr ""
"`BlueRobotics T100、T200 和 T500 推进器 <https://www.bluerobotics.com/product-"
"category/thrusters/>`__ 是常用推进器，可使用 :ref:`常规可反转无刷电机 ESC <common-brushless-"
"escs>` 控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/thrusters.rst:11 2bcd3ea3f9a14f729fa7ace7f25630f9
msgid ""
"Clockwise and Counter-Clockwise propellers are included and should be used "
"for skid-steering and omni vehicles to better balance the torque which could"
" affect the vehicle's heading control"
msgstr "套件包含顺时针和逆时针螺旋桨，差速转向和全向车辆应使用这两种螺旋桨以更好地平衡扭矩，避免影响车辆航向控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/thrusters.rst:13 7ab90e36e8fe435b917a8e4960619b31
msgid ""
"If using :ref:`BLHeli ESCs <common-blheli32-passthru>` use the configuration"
" app to set:"
msgstr "如果使用 :ref:`BLHeli ESC <common-blheli32-passthru>`，请使用配置软件设置："

#: ../../source/docs/thrusters.rst:15 4321c6212551441da2ae978fd1b7a4d7
msgid "\"Motor Direction\" to \"Bidirectional 3D\""
msgstr "「电机方向」设为「双向3D」"

#: ../../source/docs/thrusters.rst:16 eec7790ad00e44d08cc7f85071b6fcb5
msgid "\"Low RPM Power Protect\" to \"Off\""
msgstr "「低转速功率保护」设为「关闭」"
